{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Talking About the Future", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Enjoy the Journey", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 11, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 14, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe hypothetical situations in written and spoken interactions according to work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "The Future Continuous and Future Perfect Tenses", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Future Continuous tense to talk about something happening at a particular time in the future.<br/>You use the <span class=\"strong\">Future Perfect </span>tense to talk about an action that will be finished at some point in the future. It may be at a specific time. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you use the <span class=\"strong\">Future Continuous</span> tense, the action will have started before that moment but it will not have finished at that moment.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example:  <br/><span class=\"italic\">I will be studying at the library at 4 p.m. tomorrow. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The person will start studying at some point in the future and be studying at 4 p.m. It is not clear when the person will stop studying. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you use the <span class=\"strong\">Future Perfect</span> tense you are looking forward to a point in time. At that time in the future, you expect something to be completed.<br><br>For example: <br/> <span class=\"italic\">You can call me at work at 8 a.m. I <span class=\"strong\">will have arrived</span> at the office by 8.  <br/>The train will leave the station at 9 a.m. You will arrive at the station at 9:15 a.m. When you arrive, the train <span class=\"strong\">will have left</span>.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look at the chart for the structure of the Future Continuous and Future Perfect tenses:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Name\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Structure\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Future Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">will</span> (<span class=\\\"italic\\\">not</span>) + <span class=\\\"italic\\\">be</span> + verb <span class=\\\"italic\\\">-ing</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I <span class=\\\"strong\\\">will be eating</span> dinner at 7 tonight at my friend's house. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Future Perfect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">will</span> + <span class=\\\"italic\\\">have</span> + past participle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Will</span> I <span class=\\\"strong\\\">have saved</span> a large enough nest egg for my retirement? </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "I will be eating dinner at 7 tonight at my friend's house.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Will I have made any of these big decisions over the next five years? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Will my career be transforming into something else? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Will I have saved a large enough nest egg for my retirement? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Will I be controlling my own future?", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "The Future", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use four different tenses to talk about the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you talk about things that are not decided or when you make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future, you use the modal <span class=\"italic\">will</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you ask about intentions, you use <span class=\"italic\">be going to</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future, you use the Present Continuous tense.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you talk about schedules, you use the Simple Present. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong italic\\\">Will</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">What will happen in society during our lifetime? </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong italic\\\">Be going to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Am I going to get married? Am I going to be a mother?  </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Continuous</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I am working every day next week.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Simple Present</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Tomorrow my gym opens at 6 a.m.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "a vast array", "type": "name"}, {"content": "extremely large selection", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We need to be respectful of this beautiful world which is home to angelfish, clownfish, turtles and a vast array of corals, as well as other wildlife.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words to review.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "nest egg", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an amount of money that is saved over a long period of time to pay for something in the future", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Will I have saved a large enough nest egg for my retirement? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "retirement", "type": "name"}, {"content": " the time (particularly in old age) after you stop working", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I am starting a retirement fund as soon as I pay off the trip.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "cramped", "type": "name"}, {"content": "tight and with very little space to move around", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  How cramped will our cities be? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to morph into", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to  transform;  change into something entirely different", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:   Will human life morph into something we don't understand? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "unrecognizable", "type": "name"}, {"content": "difficult to recognize or identify", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Will human life morph into something unrecognizable to us?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob11aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "irreplaceable", "type": "name"}, {"content": "not possible to replace at any cost", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:   Will this fragile and irreplaceable earth survive?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob11aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Find the documentary <span class=\"italic\">The Secret Powers of Time.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Watch it and take notes on the comments that are made about the future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Discuss the ideas from the documentary with a friend.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I watch a documentary about the future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I take notes on the documentary.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I discuss the ideas in the documentary with someone.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn9le14ob11re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn9le14ob11re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "The future is not ahead of us. It is now.  All of you have a vast array of concerns, questions and fears about the road ahead. I, too, have questions.<br/>\nWhat will my own small world be like? Am I going to get married? Am I going to be a mother?  Will I be a single parent? Will I have made any of these big decisions over the next five years? Will my career be transforming into something else? Will I have saved a large enough nest egg for my retirement? Will I be controlling my own future?"}, {"image": "engenn9le14ob11re2img01.jpg", "time": "38000", "id": 2, "text": "What will happen in our society during our lifetime? Will we have achieved world peace, or will we have begun another world war? Will most of us be living to a hundred because of advancements in medicine, nutrition and mental health? How cramped will our cities be? Will human life morph into something unrecognizable to us? Will this fragile and irreplaceable Earth survive?"}, {"image": "engenn9le14ob11re2img02.jpg", "time": "62800", "id": 3, "text": "I expect a few things in the future: in the next few months or more, I will be here in Cambridge. Tomorrow my gym opens at 6 a.m., and I am working out as I usually do. I will be eating dinner at 7 tonight at my friend's house. I am working every day next week and I am seeing a movie tomorrow. This is the future I know. Everything else is less certain, so I will live my life for the moment but keep in mind that anything is possible. I hope for the best but prepare for the worst."}], "audiosrc": "engenn9le14ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le14ob11re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about jobs, work, money, emotions and behavior.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about future action.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about what I will be doing or what I will have done.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " How much do you want to know about the future?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " How much control do you think we have over the future?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Let's review!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "questions